Error: Jet.DuplicateSwizzleLane: Write swizzle `rr` repeats a lane on `[Float#3]`
  --> Tests/UI/swizzle_color_overlap_write.jet:4:7
    |
  4 |     c.rr = [Float#2]{9.0, 8.0}
    |       ^^
 Why: Each lane may be written at most once — overlapping patterns like `v.xx` have no single meaning
 Fix: Assign each lane once, e.g. `c.xy = …` instead of `c.rr = …`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.DuplicateSwizzleLane
